    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d454">

                <pb facs="0528" n="468" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg468"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Runyon</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-09-11"><hi rendition="#italic">September 11,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Statements by gentlemen person ally familiar with Stern case convince Department
                    that he has been most harshly treated. Pardon or commutation being now the only
                    recourse, you will use your utmost efforts to secure remission of sentence of
                    imprisonment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
